        <div class="bluf">
            💼 BLUF: R&D investment totals <strong>$472,156.11</strong> across four cost buckets, with Smartmotion dominating at 65.4% of spend. All 42 line items are accounted for and priced. The ledger reconciles cleanly with no unallocated amounts.
