            <div class="section-title">Executive Summary</div>
            <p>
                The R&D ledger for RY2024 reflects committed investment in three primary development categories (Smartmotion, VSETT, ZERO) plus six miscellaneous items held in the ORPHAN bucket pending reallocation. Cost data is deterministic—each bucket total derives from either formal category subtotals or itemised pricing with no gaps.
