            <p>
                Smartmotion commands 65.4% of total spend ($308,851.17), indicating concentration risk. VSETT contributes 25.5% ($120,640.26). ZERO and ORPHAN buckets account for 7.3% and 1.7% respectively. The distribution aligns with stated development priorities, though the ORPHAN bucket signals incomplete categorisation in six instances.
