            <p>
                <strong>Recommendation:</strong> Accept the R&D ledger as reconciled and auditable. All 42 line items are priced; all buckets sum correctly to the $472,156.11 grand total.
            </p>
            <p>
                <strong>Actions required:</strong>
            </p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>By 7 August 2026 (Finance/Project Mgmt):</strong> Realloc or close the ORPHAN bucket items ($8,000). Provide written confirmation of final project assignment.</li>
                <li><strong>By 14 August 2026 (Audit/Finance):</strong> Spot-check the underlying detail ledger for the three primary buckets. Confirm that the 44 itemised line items sum to the published subtotals ($308,851.17 + $120,640.26 + $34,664.68).</li>
